{
  "name": "Aurevia Practice OS - Incoming Reactivation Conversation",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Aurevia Practice OS Inbound Conversation Engine\n\nPrimary Webhook: POST /webhook/patient-reply\nLegacy Webhook: POST /webhook/patient-reactivation\nTest Webhook: POST /webhook-test/patient-reply\n\nIncoming WhatsApp message processor:\n1. Supports phone/From, message/text/Body, timestamp, message_id/MessageSid\n2. Immediate opt-out compliance (STOP, UNSUBSCRIBE, CANCEL, QUIT, etc.)\n3. Finds patient in Google Sheets CRM by normalized phone\n4. Deduplicates against message_id\n5. Evaluates intent with OpenAI using strict verified spa rules\n6. Escalates complaints/medical concerns to Human Queue sheet\n7. Delivers booking link for booking intent without false confirmation\n8. Sends WhatsApp reply & logs all messages to Conversations sheet\n9. Returns standardized JSON response contract"
      },
